---
import MainGridLayout from '../layouts/MainGridLayout.astro';
---
<MainGridLayout title="页面未找到">
  <meta slot="head" name="robots" content="noindex,follow" />
  <section class="card-base p-8 md:p-12">
    <p class="text-[var(--primary)] font-bold mb-4">404 · 走到了一条小岔路</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-90 mb-4">这里暂时没有页面</h1>
    <p class="text-75 leading-8">链接可能已经改变。回到首页，或者去文章页继续看看吧。</p>
    <div class="flex gap-4 mt-8"><a class="btn-regular rounded-xl px-5 py-3" href="/">首页</a><a class="btn-regular rounded-xl px-5 py-3" href="/archive/">文章</a></div>
  </section>
</MainGridLayout>
